\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Captain of Israel's host, and Guide
\par Of all who seek the land above,
\par Beneath Thy shadow we abide,
\par The cloud of Thy protecting love;
\par Our strength, Thy grace; our rule, Thy word;
\par Our end, the glory of the Lord.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. By Thine unerring Spirit led,
\par We shall not in the desert stray;
\par We shall not full direction need,
\par Nor miss our providential way;
\par As far from danger as from fear,
\par While love, almighty love, is near.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

